  "title": {
    "zh": "失图的检修区",
    "en": "The Unmapped Wing"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "三张未登记的地图 · 去重回溯 · 返回入口",
    "en": "Three unmapped layouts · Revisit tracking · Return to entry"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "给三张形状不同的检修图写同一份搜索程序。地图可能有回环和死路，起点均是出口。扫描只显示与当前位置相邻的四格，找到的零件要全部带回。每张地图给足了每格初访和返回各走一次以及拾取的回合，重复探索可能会超时。",
    "en": "Write one search program for three different maintenance layouts. Maps can have loops and dead ends, and the entrance is also the exit. A scan reports only the four adjacent tiles. Retrieve all parts and return to the entrance. Each budget allows one arrival and return per tile plus pickups, so exploring the same branches again can run over budget."
  },
